1
00:01:08,570 --> 00:01:12,970
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,050 --> 00:01:15,980
[Episode 10]

3
00:01:16,510 --> 00:01:17,930
[The Cheating Scandal Unfolds]

4
00:01:17,940 --> 00:01:19,470
[Actor Zhao Xiao
Dances Closely with a Woman]

5
00:01:25,510 --> 00:01:27,590
I wasted so much money watching his shows!

6
00:01:27,590 --> 00:01:29,280
I didn't expect him to be a scumbag!

7
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:30,140
I want a refund!

8
00:01:30,230 --> 00:01:32,120
How can a man
with a kid be so shameless?

9
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:34,250
Such a tainted actor should be banned!

10
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:36,410
I won't watch any of his shows anymore!

11
00:01:45,479 --> 00:01:46,310
Hello?

12
00:01:47,310 --> 00:01:49,810
Contact these top websites immediately

13
00:01:50,280 --> 00:01:52,190
and ask what is going on.

14
00:01:54,070 --> 00:01:54,560
Okay.

15
00:01:55,070 --> 00:01:56,400
I'll wait for your call.

16
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:04,860
Now is the time to use your backer,

17
00:02:04,890 --> 00:02:06,060
Lin Di'er.

18
00:02:06,230 --> 00:02:08,630
Whatever it takes,
you have to persuade her.

19
00:02:08,630 --> 00:02:10,259
Only if she comes out and clears things up

20
00:02:10,259 --> 00:02:12,590
can you get public opinion under control.

21
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,400
Hello? Dear.

22
00:02:32,890 --> 00:02:34,620
Please, you have to believe me.

23
00:02:35,190 --> 00:02:35,960
I really have

24
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:37,620
nothing to do with that woman.

25
00:02:37,910 --> 00:02:38,430
I don't even know

26
00:02:38,430 --> 00:02:40,240
why she suddenly showed up at the bar.

27
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,500
But you look very happy

28
00:02:41,910 --> 00:02:43,280
in the photos.

29
00:02:44,650 --> 00:02:45,680
She's the director.

30
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:47,160
It's part of my job.

31
00:02:47,590 --> 00:02:48,520
I had no choice.

32
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:52,200
But I really have nothing to do with her.

33
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:54,680
[Dear]

34
00:02:52,610 --> 00:02:54,010
I've never betrayed you.

35
00:02:56,190 --> 00:02:56,840
Dear.

36
00:02:57,030 --> 00:02:58,560
There are only you and Qiao

37
00:02:58,560 --> 00:02:59,520
in my heart.

38
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:01,630
Don't believe those paparazzi.

39
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:02,710
If you believe them,

40
00:03:02,710 --> 00:03:04,240
they'll get what they want.

41
00:03:10,300 --> 00:03:12,090
Di'er, it's me.

42
00:03:12,430 --> 00:03:13,740
We'll just say

43
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:16,450
Xu Jing seduced Zhao Xiao.

44
00:03:16,710 --> 00:03:18,840
Isn't that what everyone loves to see?

45
00:03:19,030 --> 00:03:20,910
Zhao Xiao is the victim.

46
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,000
We'll also

47
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:24,240
talk to the gossip bloggers we know.

48
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:28,560
Hello?

49
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:30,120
Dear?

50
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:32,910
Okay, I got it.

51
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:34,650
I'll talk to them.

52
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,360
Just wait and see.

53
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,120
Mr. Zhao, everything's ready.

54
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:47,380
We can start shooting.

55
00:03:47,470 --> 00:03:48,079
Okay.

56
00:03:51,430 --> 00:03:52,760
Are you still shooting?

57
00:03:53,030 --> 00:03:55,190
Should I tell them you're not feeling well

58
00:03:55,190 --> 00:03:56,450
and need to rest first?

59
00:03:57,630 --> 00:03:58,430
Yes.

60
00:03:59,030 --> 00:04:00,360
Of course I'm shooting.

61
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:01,680
This angle.

62
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,150
Right.

63
00:04:03,150 --> 00:04:05,120
Oh my god, I can't believe this happened.

64
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:05,770
That's right.

65
00:04:05,770 --> 00:04:07,620
Oh my god, that's so disgusting.

66
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:09,870
And he cheated.

67
00:04:09,870 --> 00:04:11,030
Yeah, look.

68
00:04:11,030 --> 00:04:12,830
I never thought

69
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:17,070
that one day I'd be deceived
by my own husband.

70
00:04:21,269 --> 00:04:23,000
Thank you all for your concern.

71
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:25,410
No matter how many mistakes
Zhao Xiao has made,

72
00:04:25,410 --> 00:04:26,990
the child is innocent.

73
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:29,860
I don't want her life to be disturbed.

74
00:04:30,830 --> 00:04:31,480
Everyone,

75
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,490
please leave.

76
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:36,600
Miss Lin!

77
00:04:37,510 --> 00:04:38,720
Do you know

78
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:41,050
who your husband is having an affair with?

79
00:04:43,450 --> 00:04:44,570
I know.

80
00:04:45,190 --> 00:04:47,650
She's the director
of Zhao Xiao's last show,

81
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:48,930
Xu Jing.

82
00:04:49,190 --> 00:04:50,659
Xu Jing?

83
00:04:50,690 --> 00:04:52,110
Why is it her?

84
00:04:52,210 --> 00:04:53,520
Is that true?

85
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:56,420
W-What's going on?

86
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:57,950
I'm sorry, Mr. Zhao.

87
00:04:57,950 --> 00:04:59,340
I'm sorry, Mr. Zhao.

88
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:02,890
Xiao.

89
00:05:03,270 --> 00:05:04,540
I'm sorry, Mr. Zhao.

90
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,830
We've shot enough for today.

91
00:05:05,830 --> 00:05:07,630
Why don't you take a break first?

92
00:05:08,110 --> 00:05:09,160
I'm sorry.

93
00:05:10,310 --> 00:05:12,280
W-What's going on with you guys?

94
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:14,950
Help me check

95
00:05:14,950 --> 00:05:16,070
the relationship
between those media outlets

96
00:05:16,070 --> 00:05:17,720
on the trending list and Lin Di'er.

97
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:18,830
I suspect there's something fishy here.

98
00:05:18,830 --> 00:05:19,490
Okay.

99
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,310
Will it affect you?

100
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:24,360
It's fine. I can handle it.

101
00:05:24,950 --> 00:05:26,250
By the way, Jia'an,

102
00:05:26,310 --> 00:05:28,070
if Lin Di'er makes a move...

103
00:05:28,070 --> 00:05:29,210
I'll tell you right away.

104
00:05:29,210 --> 00:05:30,190
Don't worry.

105
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,620
Leave Lin Di'er to me.

106
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:32,950
You just deal with Zhao Xiao.

107
00:05:32,950 --> 00:05:33,520
Okay.

108
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:34,980
Thank you, Jia'an.

109
00:05:39,140 --> 00:05:42,409
[Fang Qi]

110
00:05:44,510 --> 00:05:46,510
She's trying to push you into the fire.

111
00:05:46,510 --> 00:05:48,140
But she promised earlier.

112
00:05:48,270 --> 00:05:49,870
Now the commercials are gone.

113
00:05:49,870 --> 00:05:52,390
Several shows that were set
have contacted me to replace you.

114
00:05:52,390 --> 00:05:53,510
She's warning me.

115
00:05:54,270 --> 00:05:55,040
Warning?

116
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,830
She wants to use this farce to tell me

117
00:05:57,830 --> 00:05:58,360
whether my future

118
00:05:58,360 --> 00:06:00,270
is good or bad is up to her.

119
00:06:01,310 --> 00:06:02,390
What should we do?

120
00:06:04,310 --> 00:06:06,240
She just wants me to beg her, right?

121
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,370
Then I'll go beg her.

122
00:06:08,430 --> 00:06:09,960
Isn't that what I'm best at?

123
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:28,700
How is it? Are the results out?

124
00:06:28,870 --> 00:06:30,600
No matter what the results are,

125
00:06:30,830 --> 00:06:33,000
-you need to be prepared.
-Don’t worry.

126
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,090
I am prepared.

127
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:02,890
It's Zhao Xiao.

128
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:12,950
Thank you.

129
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:35,390
Fang Qi.

130
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:37,050
Do me another favor.

131
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:46,170
Do a paternity test for me and Qiao too.

132
00:07:46,510 --> 00:07:47,040
Okay.

133
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:50,940
That's amazing.

134
00:07:51,430 --> 00:07:51,960
Catch it.

135
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,360
You almost caught it, didn't you?

136
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:55,890
It's okay. Let's try again.

137
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:02,390
Qiao.

138
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:04,310
Qiao.

139
00:08:04,310 --> 00:08:04,950
Come here.

140
00:08:06,260 --> 00:08:06,980
Look,

141
00:08:07,390 --> 00:08:08,360
who's back?

142
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,480
-Dad.
-Dad is back.

143
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:12,070
Tell Dad,

144
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:14,120
"You worked hard."

145
00:08:14,190 --> 00:08:16,600
You worked hard, Dad.

146
00:08:19,510 --> 00:08:20,970
Take Qiao back to her room.

147
00:08:21,630 --> 00:08:22,270
Go on.

148
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:49,890
Why did you say those things
to the reporters?

149
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:50,670
Do you have any idea

150
00:08:50,670 --> 00:08:52,600
that doing so could ruin my career?

151
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:55,480
So you do know

152
00:08:56,390 --> 00:08:58,430
that messing around with other women

153
00:08:58,430 --> 00:08:59,360
can ruin you.

154
00:09:00,910 --> 00:09:03,310
We're talking about two different things.

155
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:14,510
Fine.

156
00:09:15,410 --> 00:09:16,110
Dear.

157
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:18,380
I was wrong about this.

158
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:20,320
Please don't be mad.

159
00:09:31,670 --> 00:09:33,270
I really just did it for work.

160
00:09:34,670 --> 00:09:36,270
I know you don't like Xu Jing.

161
00:09:36,670 --> 00:09:37,360
At worst,

162
00:09:38,040 --> 00:09:40,480
I won't have any
contact with her in the future.

163
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:41,810
I'll only listen to you.

164
00:09:47,930 --> 00:09:50,010
I was just playing along with her.

165
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:51,500
You know that best.

166
00:09:52,190 --> 00:09:54,250
I just wanted to get the best project.

167
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:57,980
Everyone out there says I rely on my wife.

168
00:09:58,560 --> 00:10:00,820
I want to achieve something on my own.

169
00:10:01,790 --> 00:10:03,050
Can you understand me?

170
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:05,720
Why do you care about
what other people say?

171
00:10:05,740 --> 00:10:06,930
They don't matter.

172
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:08,330
Zhao Xiao.

173
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:09,750
In this industry,

174
00:10:09,750 --> 00:10:11,720
who doesn't want a financial backer?

175
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:12,910
You, Zhao Xiao, are lucky

176
00:10:12,910 --> 00:10:14,110
to have me, Lin Di'er,

177
00:10:15,670 --> 00:10:16,840
to rely on.

178
00:10:18,390 --> 00:10:18,910
Right.

179
00:10:19,870 --> 00:10:20,470
I'm nothing

180
00:10:20,470 --> 00:10:21,680
without you.

181
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:23,550
I swear,

182
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,380
from beginning to end,

183
00:10:25,790 --> 00:10:27,520
you're the only one in my heart.

184
00:10:28,510 --> 00:10:29,030
Good.

185
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:30,810
Very good.

186
00:10:32,630 --> 00:10:34,860
Then I'll hold a press conference
in a few days

187
00:10:34,860 --> 00:10:36,320
to clear things up for you.

188
00:10:37,790 --> 00:10:38,970
So you forgive me?

189
00:10:48,390 --> 00:10:49,870
You must always remember

190
00:10:50,700 --> 00:10:52,410
that only I, Lin Di'er,

191
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:54,320
can make you hit rock bottom.

192
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:56,440
And only I

193
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:59,000
can bring you back to life.
